  <!-- Direct Answer Executive Summary -->
  <div class="direct-answer">
    <p><strong>Executive Summary:</strong> Flight Sun Tracker is an open-source TypeScript and HTML5 Canvas application that calculates the sun's azimuth and altitude relative to an aircraft's heading along great-circle routes. It solves the traveler dilemma of window seat glare versus shade by delivering instant seat-specific solar exposure breakdowns.</p>
  </div>

